{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5fc96d9e13c86370ea1836ef2f40d06f42873e3ec4d029cdf00c67a74effee8b", "ja": "『織姫』の『妹』", "zh": "“织女”的“妹妹”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "87e246fbb52419e068e5ab0c9806ef2f9687e05c6e6decf6c65a999e614df1ff", "ja": "織姫亡き後、アイドル養成スクールへ通う事\nになった真珠星。初日から過酷なレッスンに\nへばっていると、同じ研修性の『なる』に\n助けられる。真珠星は、姉が人知れず大変な\n努力をしていた事を初めて知る。", "zh": "织姬去世后，真珠星开始前往偶像培训学校学习。第一天就被严酷的课程折腾得精疲力竭时，她得到了同届学员“成”的帮助。真珠星也第一次知道，姐姐曾在人知晓的地方付出了艰苦的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d49222b07f9afe5b4520a5910abb2e3b75061fd41848b6ecd4a900275dbcd072", "ja": "（稽古は熱を増しつつ、進んだ。\n今日はいよいよ、初の通し稽古だ）", "zh": "（排练逐渐进入高潮，并继续进行着。\n今天终于要进行第一次完整排练了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f06209933107e3265bf1386f45211fb289519606a049933abf3146919fe5353d", "ja": "（アイドルである姉の織姫が事故で亡くなり、\n妹の真珠星がアイドルを目指すことになる所からだ）", "zh": "（故事从身为偶像的姐姐织姬因事故去世，妹妹真珠星决定以偶像为目标开始。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "b58f94df9fb09a07f276162bb194ae00d78efd99c9c25cfd364b1d49cbb06bd5", "ja": "今日から、この養成スクールがあなたの学校よ。\n死ぬ気で頑張ってね。", "zh": "从今天起，这所培训学校就是你的学校了。\n拼命努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "59274153e5e3e4faef95e565482d08b0e52bef046466d57a781d439e5b88336d", "ja": "今日から……ここに……。", "zh": "从今天起……就要在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "b61014b07cef405a74765325ebd1d7632ad300e7c4be3c9b09af55aac387f1ec", "ja": "こんな、授業料の高いスクールに……！\nお姉ちゃんはタダだったのに……！", "zh": "居然要来这种学费昂贵的学校……！\n明明姐姐当时可是免费的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "385e4ce19b70fc862eb276c52db990e2cd715c5aba08f1906f6a85075c1d36d9", "ja": "織姫は才能があったもの。\nその稼ぎで今あなたもここにいるはずよ。", "zh": "织姬以前很有天赋嘛。\n你现在应该就是靠她赚的钱才能在这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "ee0075556b76289e8d8cba1acb0119710375b6c5e5eff8553fcdf1af518581d7", "ja": "せっかくお姉ちゃんが遺してくれたお金なのに！\nていうかあなた、稼げるって言ってなかった！？", "zh": "明明是姐姐好不容易留给我的钱啊！话说回来，你之前不是还说能赚到钱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "4481773c7a365cdbcfaebeeec11f2f7e2187362f8e24a5a0871d96a113588469", "ja": "初期投資はつきものでしょ。このチャンスを\n活かせるかどうかは、あなた次第。", "zh": "初期投资是少不了的。能不能抓住这个机会，就看你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "cda2ba8fe8c5dff2c764fb5f14b0fa987f90f04f1a307df0360f906aca124ff4", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……。", "zh": "唔唔……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "568aa02e80f14c6f40694d2c77b8856a0b93466e7d9c431679f804f98900dec9", "ja": "みんな、集まって！　今日から参加する研修生よ。\n……真珠星、自己紹介しなさい。", "zh": "大家，集合！这是从今天开始参加培训的练习生。\n……真珠星，做个自我介绍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "f69851879d453e441f6b015e39d91efd7d2a45a71784059684eb6244aac82b6f", "ja": "い……一宮真珠星、です。\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "一……一宫真珠星。\n请多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "44ee90661af57db558c024d6a8bb9124bbf6e2045b248691379bad43156da7a7", "ja": "？　一宮って、もしかして……？", "zh": "？一宫这个姓，难道是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "d43164c7ae2b436714531f729b9236093f299487474387bfb8015365f1018c11", "ja": "一宮織姫の妹よ。\n芸能の世界は初めてだから、いろいろ教えてあげて。", "zh": "她是织姬的妹妹。\n她第一次接触演艺圈，就请你多教教她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f6a75b70c3cb49452cce808ffa4bf82df78a7851f20a6ea108a9d600abf5993", "ja": "げえっ！？", "zh": "呃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1014_traineea", "source_sha256": "230d2ff4cc923226da51c525444fee7324a65d8093f82900a401e1f92a7738e5", "ja": "織姫の妹！？\nえーっ、なんかちんちくりん……。", "zh": "织姬的妹妹！？\n诶——总觉得有点小巧玲珑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1015_traineeb", "source_sha256": "f0eb203f6b063e130a51cad59877247a08ad8545338dd90508da9e3be64ad6ea", "ja": "家族だからって、素人が飛び込んできたわけ？\nアイドル舐めすぎじゃない？", "zh": "就因为是一家人，外行人就这么闯进来了？\n也太小看偶像了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "2f341453aea84b1dcef2acf99aca414868373ce20248b2c0e9af3dce02131b33", "ja": "ち、ちょっと！　お姉ちゃんのこととか、\n初めは隠しておいた方が良いに決まってるでしょ！？", "zh": "等、等一下！姐姐的事情什么的，一开始当然还是先瞒着比较好吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "eb61321777c161fe3e6e67c7aff126e8bf2589021831a1f6887c7f8a72da33ad", "ja": "隠す気だったの？\n後からバレた方が、心証が悪いと思うけど。", "zh": "你本来打算瞒着的吗？我觉得要是之后被发现，反而会给人留下更差的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "c688a67fe38e1b707c70d3f2f3ab90c7c1def7fcfe207a24b959138aa08715e3", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "5d95fab505ada52f30cf17e4ac7e75774a6c7550dbb0bf9ac38846475f440f98", "ja": "かくして、私のアイドル研修生としての\nレッスンが始まった……のだけど……。", "zh": "就这样，我作为偶像练习生的训练开始了……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "8ae684fc777fa021c710384710233bfd6d60865fd5e297c3c41351061ab386e3", "ja": "ひい、ひい……！　おかしいでしょ！\n初日から何なの、この練習量……！", "zh": "呼，呼……！这不对吧！\n第一天就练这么多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "a7916598e8dd02306958639454241d7d740f5ee5b8db050d493d660b74c23b04", "ja": "運動しすぎて、クラクラする……。\nなんか……は、吐きそう、かも……。", "zh": "运动过量，头好晕……\n好像……要、要吐出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "4037a47c8875488f201bb4babf0a532de0b3e6f6146b24a12d4e3181310df466", "ja": "あ、あの……大丈夫？", "zh": "啊，那个……你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee5b6e9bee2f6d919e0f5f42fd236bfd0cc0b76ce2879d28339f2d6b18517ff8", "ja": "スポドリ……飲むのが難しいなら、\n塩飴舐めるだけでも楽になると思うから。", "zh": "运动饮料……要是喝起来困难的话，\n光是含着盐糖，应该也会舒服一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "92b05a6a71d3eb013a6dae8c77f21ab1cd965e00869a1096994807bb0553ea33", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。\nえっと……？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……\n那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "9affa5e4e02a69f8d3cbcde29a223bee98e7bf3ee77e4b12aad2eb14c9ad4709", "ja": "私、『三船（みふね）なる』って言います。\n真珠星さん、だよね？　よろしくね！", "zh": "我叫\"三船鸣\"。\n你是真珠星吧？请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7ba74b4fb078faf97902a9db3f92bf473feb82072edef2804d44b1046a6d85c", "ja": "うん、よろしくね。なるさん。", "zh": "嗯，请多指教，なる小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "4f3fb817f44f1f926e0b7bbea481c6755bfd5a0d7709909d753f8453a20bed6a", "ja": "真珠星さん、お姉さんと比べられて……大変だね。\nその、色々言われてたから……。", "zh": "被拿来和珍珠星小姐的姐姐比较……真辛苦啊。\n那个，因为你被说了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "efbeba3cc2b0b325436752b7926e8a34db36a86021c5ee3ddfb0f2b92a27acc7", "ja": "うーん……それは別に、気にならないかな。\nお姉ちゃんがすごいのは本当のことだし。", "zh": "嗯……那个我倒是不太在意。\n姐姐很厉害，这是事实嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a5d9532ebac29c5dcd8fca52f4e29c9fb62bf31ce461c87ffa95dbe0110175e", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ……。\n強いんだね……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……\n你还真厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "390a90f6e6bfdfceca0a865ab899f1eb977fcb55226a866904c19775db2e3106", "ja": "よ、ようやく一日が終わったぁ……。\nつま先から顔まで、全部の筋肉が痛いよぉ……。", "zh": "终、终于熬过这一天了啊……\n从脚尖到脸颊，全身的肌肉都在痛呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "45c8537dccb354ab43bc53d7d46783b4c0dde4829e46d2c73e8b85180101afa5", "ja": "神宮寺とかいう女……初日からこの調子なんて、\n本当に殺すつもりなんじゃないの……。", "zh": "神宫寺那个女人……第一天就这副架势，\n该不会真的想把人逼死吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab1f7c437f6bf660f4d5f14d67711997e925317d39b577658a4214f4e167e26e", "ja": "……。\nお姉ちゃんは、これをこなしてたんだ……。", "zh": "……。\n姐姐以前就是把这些都完成的啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_03_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "ffe986cb863f083eab1eea11f624447bb69c0d5d3e76b5c5ea39c0d207fc3dc0", "ja": "……勉強しよ。", "zh": "……去学习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
